  "instructions": [
    "Roast the oiled potato wedges at 425°F for five minutes.",
    "Toss the broccoli with garlic oil, add it to the tray, and roast both vegetables until crisp.",
    "Season and pan-sear the chicken until browned and cooked to 165°F, then let it rest.",
    "Simmer the remaining garlic with balsamic vinegar, honey, broth, and water until glossy.",
    "Whisk butter into the glaze, return the chicken to the pan, and turn it until coated.",
    "Serve the glazed chicken with the roasted broccoli and potatoes."
